# Boost on 40's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# HP and PP refilled for the climb's trainers and Spear Pillar after it; Bibarel's field moves set again
# (Rock Climb, Rock Smash, Surf, Strength: Mt Coronet's walls, rocks, water and the 2F boulder).
party-level 0 86
party-move 0 0 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
party-move 0 1 MOVE_CRUNCH
party-move 0 2 MOVE_SEED_BOMB
party-move 0 3 MOVE_STONE_EDGE
party-move 2 0 MOVE_ROCK_CLIMB
party-move 2 1 MOVE_ROCK_SMASH
party-move 2 2 MOVE_SURF
party-move 2 3 MOVE_STRENGTH
party-level 4 80
